  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Seems like on avatars uploaded after the newest update that use aim constraints flip the aim constraint up vector on the Y axis 180 degrees.\n\nThis basically breaks aim constraints that need a specific up direction.\n\nThis issue is NOT present in unity, and only happens ingame after uploading the avatar.\n\nIn these images are 3 aim constraints (with very slight setting variations) all pointing towards the floor at a point, the L faces upwards in unity. Ingame they all flip downwards instead.",
